(7693306, 1261203, 4008, '<td valign="top">Funny. A different approach. But the image is so clean that it does not give me a feeling that I associate with a nightmare (although I would not want to be out of coffee).</td>', 'Funny. A different approach. But the image is so clean that it does not give me a feeling that I associate with a nightmare (although I would not want to be out of coffee).', '2021-05-03 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
