(7693308, 1261221, 4008, '<td valign="top">The ghost could have been a bit more obvious, so it would not need the title to make it clear.</td>', 'The ghost could have been a bit more obvious, so it would not need the title to make it clear.', '2021-05-03 13:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
