(7693310, 1261152, 4008, '<td valign="top">Clear nightmare. I like the tension that is shown in the body.</td>', 'Clear nightmare. I like the tension that is shown in the body.', '2021-05-03 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693314, 1261122, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is definitely nightmarish, Roz!   Flies are not pretty to me, although they probably are to you.   People don''t understand my frogs and toads either. :D<br/> <br/>I wish the light sources matched a bit better, but that''s hard to capture it all at the same light.   But, being the Bug Whisperer...  Couldn''t you have asked him to turn a bit?  :D<br/> <br/>Good entry, Roz!   Perfect for the topic.</td>', 'This is definitely nightmarish, Roz!   Flies are not pretty to me, although they probably are to you.   People don''t understand my frogs and toads either. :D I wish the light sources matched a bit better, but that''s hard to capture it all at the same light.   But, being the Bug Whisperer...  Couldn''t you have asked him to turn a bit?  :D Good entry, Roz!   Perfect for the topic.', '2021-05-03 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
