(7693370, 1261209, 93283, '<td valign="top">Far and away the best image of the challenge... I can''t speak for how other voters will react to this image, but who hasn''t had a blurry grainy vivid hallway dream/nightmare??? This image leaves you hanging on so many levels, in much the same way a nightmare does. Very well done for this challenge and my favorite! 10</td>', 'Far and away the best image of the challenge... I can''t speak for how other voters will react to this image, but who hasn''t had a blurry grainy vivid hallway dream/nightmare??? This image leaves you hanging on so many levels, in much the same way a nightmare does. Very well done for this challenge and my favorite! 10', '2021-05-03 22:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
