(7693383, 1261152, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh man that is my ultimate nightmare! Great depiction.<br/> <br/>My only nitpick is the distracting elements on the sheets, go plain next time to draw the eyes to you and the snake.<br/> <br/>And LOL to the teddy bear that is in bed with you. My pick for red.</td>', 'Oh man that is my ultimate nightmare! Great depiction. My only nitpick is the distracting elements on the sheets, go plain next time to draw the eyes to you and the snake. And LOL to the teddy bear that is in bed with you. My pick for red.', '2021-05-04 04:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693395, 1261211, 4008, '<td valign="top">I did not know the Sandman story as something scary, so I did some further research. I now understand and recognise some elements in your picture.  Of course, technically extremely well done. I especially like the consistent way of using the light and how this adds atmosphere to the image. It is very clean though for a nightmare, does not feel very menacing.</td>', 'I did not know the Sandman story as something scary, so I did some further research. I now understand and recognise some elements in your picture.  Of course, technically extremely well done. I especially like the consistent way of using the light and how this adds atmosphere to the image. It is very clean though for a nightmare, does not feel very menacing.', '2021-05-04 05:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693399, 1261122, 3306, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Honey I shrunk the kids Well done. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Reminds me of Honey I shrunk the kids Well done. One of my favorites.', '2021-05-04 07:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693400, 1261217, 3306, '<td valign="top">Funny! At first I thought he was putting the gas on the wrong side and then I realized it was a Tesla! Either way the humor is appreciated.</td>', 'Funny! At first I thought he was putting the gas on the wrong side and then I realized it was a Tesla! Either way the humor is appreciated.', '2021-05-04 07:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
