(7693889, 1261211, 173844, '<td valign="top">Being torn from your (I''m assuming) child is certainly an unbearable horror.  This image forcefully conveys the lofted man''s emotional anguish.  It''s dynamic and unfolds with a fine palette.  I do wonder, however, why the girl''s demeanor is rather placid.  Must be a reason for this. <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Being torn from your (I''m assuming) child is certainly an unbearable horror.  This image forcefully conveys the lofted man''s emotional anguish.  It''s dynamic and unfolds with a fine palette.  I do wonder, however, why the girl''s demeanor is rather placid.  Must be a reason for this. Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-05-09 23:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693890, 1261227, 3306, '<td valign="top">That is a cute little critter. I hope he did his business before you let him back in the house!</td>', 'That is a cute little critter. I hope he did his business before you let him back in the house!', '2021-05-09 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
