(7693908, 1261211, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> I so appreciate the creative thought and skill that it takes to compose this. Im wondering that to fit the challenge description if the child should have more of a fearful expression?  That is not important though for my enjoyment of your work in and of itself. Those hands are really creepy! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Its funny I was thinking the exact same thing, about your girl and her expression, maybe shes just brave!<br/> <br/>The hands on the outer and the horns they are what freaked me out. Well photographed, another one for 1x.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: I so appreciate the creative thought and skill that it takes to compose this. Im wondering that to fit the challenge description if the child should have more of a fearful expression?  That is not important though for my enjoyment of your work in and of itself. Those hands are really creepy!   Its funny I was thinking the exact same thing, about your girl and her expression, maybe shes just brave! The hands on the outer and the horns they are what freaked me out. Well photographed, another one for 1x. ', '2021-05-10 01:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
