(7693958, 1261122, 114969, '<td valign="top">Yes, handling shadows AND depth of field at the same time can be very tricky. I love these challenges, it is a great way to work on new skills, opening new horizons each time! Anyway, this is a great image, and I''m glad you got some ribbon for it, much deserved. Congrats!</td>', 'Yes, handling shadows AND depth of field at the same time can be very tricky. I love these challenges, it is a great way to work on new skills, opening new horizons each time! Anyway, this is a great image, and I''m glad you got some ribbon for it, much deserved. Congrats!', '2021-05-10 06:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7693959, 1261131, 114969, '<td valign="top">I had no idea you were into 3D creations Margaret! That''s a wonderful skill. I tried to learn the basics a while ago, and it is much harder than Photoshop! I''m impressed. I''m sure you''ll be able to pull out incredible images very soon with such technique up your sleeves, can''t wait for them!</td>', 'I had no idea you were into 3D creations Margaret! That''s a wonderful skill. I tried to learn the basics a while ago, and it is much harder than Photoshop! I''m impressed. I''m sure you''ll be able to pull out incredible images very soon with such technique up your sleeves, can''t wait for them!', '2021-05-10 07:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7693960, 1261104, 3306, '<td valign="top">I tried to comment on all the entries. I looked at yours for a long while and couldnt come up with anything and then I realized maybe you are allergic?!</td>', 'I tried to comment on all the entries. I looked at yours for a long while and couldnt come up with anything and then I realized maybe you are allergic?!', '2021-05-10 07:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7693961, 1261211, 122678, '<td valign="top">Congratulations<br/>Your pictures are so incredibly amazing, each image and soul searching story behind them makes the sum of the whole even more incredible. Your passion of photography, editing to perfection and the story is so superb.<br/>Hats off to you!</td>', 'CongratulationsYour pictures are so incredibly amazing, each image and soul searching story behind them makes the sum of the whole even more incredible. Your passion of photography, editing to perfection and the story is so superb.Hats off to you!', '2021-05-10 08:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
